        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very simple city builder game with the main purpose of scaling up your population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place build orders for your citizens to build new homes, plant food or plant new trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more citizens you have the faster the city can grow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For me as the developer of this game, the purpose was to try to write efficient code to see how much a PC can handle before it begins to slow down. So try out and see how many citizens your device can handle.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a very simple city builder game with the main purpose of scaling up your population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place build orders for your citizens to build new homes, plant food or plant new trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more citizens you have the faster the city can grow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For me as the developer of this game, the purpose was to try to write efficient code to see how much a PC can handle before it begins to slow down. So try out and see how many citizens your device can handle.</p>",
        "short_description": "Start with just one citizens to build up your city. Grow it more and more and more. There is no limit in size. Just the limit of your own PC.",
